@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
actor User as user USER_COLOR
participant ":UI" as ui UI_COLOR
participant ":Logic" as logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":Model" as model MODEL_COLOR
participant ":Storage" as storage STORAGE_COLOR

title Successful member deletion: component responsibilities
user -> ui : member delete nus/A0123456X
activate ui
ui -> logic : execute("member delete nus/A0123456X")
activate logic
note over logic : Parse and dispatch the command.
logic -> model : Prepare a validated member deletion
activate model
model --> logic : Pending state and result
deactivate model
logic -> storage : Save pending state
activate storage
storage --> logic : Saved atomically
deactivate storage
logic -> model : Publish the saved state
logic --> ui : Feedback and navigation request
deactivate logic
ui --> user : Feedback and refreshed Members directory
deactivate ui
legend bottom
  Messages summarize component responsibilities rather than literal method calls.
  Model includes isolated pending state and the live observable records.
  Parse, validation or save failure leaves live records unchanged.
  The Logic component diagram expands parsing, commands and candidate creation.
endlegend
@enduml
